    title: "ACCA Exemptions for CA and ICAP Students: How They Work in 2026",
    excerpt: "What ACCA can and cannot exempt, how to find your exact list for ICAI or ICAP passes, the fees and 14-day forfeit rule, and how exemptions fit the 2027 transition.",
